  "m_TableData": {
    "Array": [
      {
        "m_Id": 21656923652096,
        "m_Localized": "Phones \u0026 Saving",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656948817920,
        "m_Localized": "You can use the phone to \u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003Esave your progress\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/color\u003E as well as call other contacts you meet in the world.\n\nMaking a call with a payphone costs \u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003E$1\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/color\u003E.",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656948817921,
        "m_Localized": "Turning on the Flashlight",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656948817922,
        "m_Localized": "Open \u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003EInventory\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/color\u003E to turn on the flashlight.\n\nThe flashlight greatly increases vision in dark areas when turned on but will consume charge while active.\n\nCombine with \u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003EBatteries\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/color\u003E to recharge the flashlight.",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012224,
        "m_Localized": "Drop Down",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012225,
        "m_Localized": "Drop down from ledges to avoid fall damage.\n\nPress \u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003EDown\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/color\u003E to hang from a ledge. Then again to drop down.\n",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012226,
        "m_Localized": "Item Box Storage",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012227,
        "m_Localized": "Use the \u003Ccolor=\u0022white\u003Etransfer\u003C/color\u003E action to move items between your inventory and storage.\n\nInventory space is very limited, only bring the essentials.",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012228,
        "m_Localized": "Melee Attacks",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012229,
        "m_Localized": "You can perform two types of attack with melee weapons.\n\n\u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003ETap\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/color\u003E {input_0} to perform a quick attack.\n\n\u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003EHold\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/color\u003E {input_0} to charge an overhead swing.",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012230,
        "m_Localized": "Equipping Melee weapons",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012231,
        "m_Localized": "Open \u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003EInventory\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/color\u003E to equip melee weapons such as the boxcutter.\n\nSelect the weapon, then use the \u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003EEquip\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/color\u003E option to equip it.",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012232,
        "m_Localized": "Equipping Ranged Weapons",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012233,
        "m_Localized": "Open \u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003EInventory\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/color\u003E to equip a firearm.",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012234,
        "m_Localized": "Keyring",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012235,
        "m_Localized": "Keys in your inventory can be \u003Ccolor=\u0022white\u003Ecombined\u003C/color\u003E with the keyring to save space in your inventory.\n \n\u003Ccolor=\u0022white\u003EUse\u003C/color\u003E the keyring to access your stored keys.",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012236,
        "m_Localized": "Evading Enemies",
        "m_Metadata": {
          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012237,
        "m_Localized": "\u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003ETap\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/color\u003E {input_0} while moving in a direction to move past enemies.",
