          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 21656953012239,
        "m_Localized": "Press \u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003EReload\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/color\u003E while aiming to begin reloading.\n\nPress \u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003EReload\u003C/color\u003E\u003C/b\u003E again while inside the highlighted area to insert ammunition.",
