          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 96861441174401024,
        "m_Localized": "Julee the Waitress can help you identify \u003Cb\u003EMementos\u003C/b\u003E found in the world. \n\nOnce identified, Mementos can be equipped and provide enhancements. \n\nUnlock more \u003Cb\u003EMemento Slots\u003C/b\u003E by providing Julee with \u003Cb\u003EIdentify Documents\u003C/b\u003E found in the world.",
        "m_Metadata": {
