          "m_Items": {
            "Array": []
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "m_Id": 128659377201737728,
        "m_Localized": "The camera item allows you to take photos as you explore. These photos will be attached to the map where the photo was taken. Sometimes you may want to note an area to return to later.\n\nYou can use {input_0} to use the currently selected item.",
