        "m_Localized": "Melee weapons will take damage after use and will eventually break.\n\rBroken weapons are much less effective. \n\nIt is possible to repair a weapon by combining it with repair items such as \u003Cb\u003E\u003Ccolor=white\u003EDuct Tape\u003C/color\u003E\u003C/b\u003E.",
