      },
      {
        "m_Id": 352008679549169664,
        "m_Localized": "Combine items by using the Combine option in the item menu.\n\nCombine herbs and bottles to produce healing \u003Ccolor=white\u003E\u003Cb\u003ETonics\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/color\u003E.",
